README.md
# Institutional Knowledge Graph API

The Knowledge Graph API is the semantic intelligence layer of the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS).

It stores and queries relationships between institutions, governance frameworks, procurement systems, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), AI systems, policies, standards, capabilities, datasets, and institutional memory.

---

## Purpose

The graph enables institutions to become machine-readable.

It supports

- Institutional intelligence
- Semantic search
- Policy reasoning
- Dependency analysis
- Institutional memory
- AI assistants
- Governance analytics

---

## Architecture

```
Policies

↓

Parser

↓

Knowledge Graph

↓

Validator

↓

Governance Score

↓

Institutional Intelligence
```

---

## Endpoints

POST /nodes

POST /edges

POST /query

POST /search

GET /graph

GET /ontology

GET /health
