The Knowledge Graph API is the semantic core of the IOS ecosystem.

Its role is to connect every institutional artifact into a unified graph:

Documents
      │
      ▼
Policy Parser
      │
      ▼
Knowledge Graph
      │
      ├──────── Institutions
      ├──────── Governance
      ├──────── Procurement
      ├──────── Standards
      ├──────── AI
      ├──────── DPI
      ├──────── Capability
      └──────── Institutional Memory
              │
              ▼
Semantic Search
      │
      ▼
IOS Validator
      │
      ▼
Governance Score
      │
      ▼
Institutional Intelligence

With this component, Legibility Office becomes more than a collection of documents and APIs. It becomes a semantic institutional platform, where policies, institutions, capabilities, and governance structures are represented as a connected knowledge graph that can power search, analytics, digital twins, and AI-assisted public administration.
